No, I just asked, just
What should I do?

997
00:48:25.027 --> 00:48:26.820
[urgent breathing]

998
00:48:26.904 --> 00:48:28.155
There is

999
00:48:28.238 --> 00:48:30.824
[breathing in relief]

1000
00:48:34.036 --> 00:48:35.495
[Child] I had a fun dream today

1001
00:48:35.579 --> 00:48:37.623
- [Woman] Huh? What dream?
- [Prison Guard] Oh So-ryong, please come in.

1002
00:48:37.706 --> 00:48:39.541
- [Soryong] Yes
- [Child, woman's grumbling sound]

1003
00:48:39.625 --> 00:48:40.542
Yes?

1004
00:48:41.043 --> 00:48:41.960
Did you allow it?

1005
00:48:42.044 --> 00:48:43.211
Yes, he said he would visit me.

1006
00:48:45.005 --> 00:48:46.381
[Prison Guard] Oh, take him in and take him in.

1007
00:48:47.841 --> 00:48:49.760
[Sound of clanging keys]

1008
00:48:55.265 --> 00:48:56.433
[Sound of door opening]

1009
00:48:59.937 --> 00:49:01.146
[Sound of door closing]

1010
00:49:09.780 --> 00:49:11.239
Looks better than last time

1011
00:49:14.701 --> 00:49:15.911
It's really good

1012
00:49:19.957 --> 00:49:21.333
sneakers

1013
00:49:22.668 --> 00:49:24.586
It was warm

1014
00:49:26.338 --> 00:49:27.798
thank you

1015
00:49:36.807 --> 00:49:38.016
me

1016
00:49:40.435 --> 00:49:41.937
We broke up

1017
00:49:42.896 --> 00:49:46.733
[So-ryong] As Yumi advises,
Good luck with your safe farewell.

1018
00:49:48.276 --> 00:49:50.153
Thanks, me too

1019
00:49:56.576 --> 00:49:58.787
[Yumi] Since when?

1020
00:49:58.870 --> 00:50:02.332
- I started to feel full.
- [♪ Sad music]

1021
00:50:04.459 --> 00:50:08.505
I just thought, ‘I guess I gained weight.’
I didn't even know I was pregnant

1022
00:50:09.673 --> 00:50:12.009
I took a break from school and gave birth at home.

1023
00:50:13.844 --> 00:50:15.721
He took care of it.

1024
00:50:17.180 --> 00:50:19.307
[Yumi’s trembling breathing]

1025
00:50:19.391 --> 00:50:22.102
A child whose umbilical cord was not cut

1026
00:50:22.185 --> 00:50:24.146
Without even blinking...

1027
00:50:26.106 --> 00:50:28.442
I think it was then

1028
00:50:28.525 --> 00:50:29.735
'Ah'

1029
00:50:31.028 --> 00:50:32.612
‘I have to kill him’

1030
00:50:35.532 --> 00:50:36.616
‘I have to kill this person’

1031
00:50:36.700 --> 00:50:40.454
‘I am in this damn hell.
'I guess I can escape'

1032
00:50:40.537 --> 00:50:42.372
[shaking breathing]

1033
00:50:43.290 --> 00:50:45.000
So I did that

1034
00:50:49.463 --> 00:50:51.548
I've never regretted it

1035
00:50:53.216 --> 00:50:55.844
But the only thing that bothers me is

1036
00:51:00.140 --> 00:51:02.809
[Crying] To my mom
I couldn't say hello

1037
00:51:04.978 --> 00:51:07.314
That was the last time

1038
00:51:13.195 --> 00:51:14.529
[Student] Where is my mom?

1039
00:51:14.613 --> 00:51:16.239
-My mom...
- [Medical device operation sound]

1040
00:51:16.323 --> 00:51:18.325
[Sounds of busy medical staff]

1041
00:51:21.119 --> 00:51:23.246
[Heavy sound effect]

1042
00:51:25.749 --> 00:51:29.211
[Yumi] People in the world
Even though I tell my mom everything

1043
00:51:31.797 --> 00:51:33.632
I understand

1044
00:51:36.843 --> 00:51:38.470
my mom

1045
00:51:41.807 --> 00:51:45.268
in that hell
Because we were together until the end

1046
00:51:49.231 --> 00:51:51.691
Sorry, my story is so depressing, right?

1047
00:51:51.775 --> 00:51:53.068
[Soryong’s whimpering sound]

1048
00:51:53.693 --> 00:51:56.571
I know, the world

1049
00:51:56.655 --> 00:51:58.073
Talk about this

1050
00:51:59.324 --> 00:52:01.451
That you won't understand

1051
00:52:01.535 --> 00:52:02.828
Mr. Yumi

1052
00:52:06.331 --> 00:52:08.500
Looks fine on the outside

1053
00:52:12.379 --> 00:52:14.589
There is no house without scars.

1054
00:52:15.966 --> 00:52:17.425
[Soryong] In someone’s eyes

1055
00:52:18.593 --> 00:52:21.179
Yumi is probably just a flower too.

1056
00:52:23.306 --> 00:52:24.724
pretty flowers

1057
00:52:26.810 --> 00:52:28.603
[Yumi’s trembling breathing]

1058
00:52:28.687 --> 00:52:29.896
Really

1059
00:52:38.238 --> 00:52:39.573
last time

1060
00:52:40.323 --> 00:52:42.576
What Attorney Choi said

1061
00:52:43.160 --> 00:52:45.287
If Yumi doesn't want it

1062
00:52:46.079 --> 00:52:48.498
- Even if it’s not broadcast…
- [Yumi] I will do it, broadcasting

1063
00:52:48.582 --> 00:52:50.542
[Yumi’s trembling breathing]

1064
00:52:52.460 --> 00:52:54.462
After entering prison

1065
00:52:55.463 --> 00:52:57.090
I slept for the first time

1066
00:52:57.174 --> 00:52:59.301
[♪ Calm music]

1067
00:52:59.384 --> 00:53:02.554
‘Rather than live like this?
I said, ‘I should just die.’

1068
00:53:04.848 --> 00:53:07.267
I changed my mind thanks to PD Han.

1069
00:53:10.604 --> 00:53:12.147
Mr. Yumi

1070
00:53:13.023 --> 00:53:14.482
How do you know PD Han?

1071
00:53:15.692 --> 00:53:19.321
You left a note in the morning.

1072
00:53:20.363 --> 00:53:23.200
[Yumi Mo’s sobbing]

1073
00:53:28.538 --> 00:53:30.165
[Rough breathing]

1074
00:53:35.253 --> 00:53:36.963
[crunching sound]

1075
00:53:44.471 --> 00:53:45.472
[sigh]

1076
00:53:53.855 --> 00:53:56.316
[Yumi] As soon as I saw you
I knew it was my mom

1077
00:54:04.324 --> 00:54:05.659
sister

1078
00:54:08.620 --> 00:54:11.289
I won't give up on my life

1079
00:54:15.418 --> 00:54:17.504
I'll live well

1080
00:54:19.214 --> 00:54:20.131
[light laughter]

1081
00:54:20.215 --> 00:54:23.343
[♪ Calm music
'Same as you are']

1082
00:54:20.215 --> 00:54:23.343
[♪ Calm music
'Same as you are']

1083
00:54:25.804 --> 00:54:28.181
[Medical device operation sound]

1084
00:54:42.153 --> 00:54:44.990
[Too-too ringing sound]

1085
00:55:08.054 --> 00:55:10.890
[♪ Calm music continues]

1086
00:55:20.650 --> 00:55:22.485
[wind sound]

1087
00:55:23.737 --> 00:55:25.655
[Sound of strong wind]

1088
00:55:27.407 --> 00:55:29.951
[Embarrassed sound]

1089
00:55:36.166 --> 00:55:37.417
[sigh]

1090
00:55:47.093 --> 00:55:48.511
[Soryong’s sigh]

1091
00:55:51.681 --> 00:55:52.849
[sigh]

1092
00:55:58.229 --> 00:55:59.272
Handdol, what is it?

1093
00:56:00.940 --> 00:56:02.275
[Soryong] At this time

1094
00:56:02.859 --> 00:56:04.569
How did you get here?

1095
00:56:04.652 --> 00:56:06.780
Oh, that kind of team leader is the one
What are you doing here?

1096
00:56:06.863 --> 00:56:07.864
[Hando] While being hit by the rain

1097
00:56:07.947 --> 00:56:09.699
[So-ryong] No
My umbrella flew away...

1098
00:56:10.450 --> 00:56:12.118
Why did you come?

1099
00:56:14.120 --> 00:56:15.872
Lee Cheol-gyu is dead

1100
00:56:17.916 --> 00:56:18.792
Is it true?

1101
00:56:22.754 --> 00:56:25.215
[Soryong] Wow! [laughter]

1102
00:56:26.841 --> 00:56:28.635
Mr. Yumi!

1103
00:56:28.718 --> 00:56:30.887
Can you hear me?

1104
00:56:31.429 --> 00:56:34.933
Yumi, you are truly free now!

1105
00:56:35.767 --> 00:56:37.936
Freedom!

1106
00:56:39.020 --> 00:56:41.106
- [Soryong’s cheers]
- Then I catch a cold.

1107
00:56:41.189 --> 00:56:42.941
Moving south!

1108
00:56:43.024 --> 00:56:44.234
[laughter]

1109
00:56:46.277 --> 00:56:49.489
To the prison staff
I'll tell you and tell you

1110
00:56:50.907 --> 00:56:53.993
[Soryong’s light elasticity]

1111
00:56:58.540 --> 00:56:59.999
[Heavy breathing]

1112
00:57:04.337 --> 00:57:05.505
[Feeding away]

1113
00:57:09.050 --> 00:57:10.885
[Sound of deep breathing]

1114
00:57:10.969 --> 00:57:14.389
[♪ Music soaring gently]

1115
00:57:24.649 --> 00:57:25.900
mom

1116
00:57:29.737 --> 00:57:32.699
[♪ Calming music]

1117
00:58:08.193 --> 00:58:09.068
[Soryong’s cough]

1118
00:58:09.152 --> 00:58:12.197
[Limit] Ah, so
Why are you doing this in the rain, you're not a child

1119
00:58:12.280 --> 00:58:13.656
[Soryong] Ah, nagging

1120
00:58:14.866 --> 00:58:16.576
Oh, if it's going to be like this, let's just go separately.

1121
00:58:18.077 --> 00:58:20.914
I'll get some medicine from over there, so stay.

1122
00:58:22.832 --> 00:58:24.000
[Closing sound]

1123
00:58:24.751 --> 00:58:27.545
[Sound of students talking]

1124
00:58:35.595 --> 00:58:38.139
- [Student] Mom!
- [Each person’s welcoming voice]

1125
00:58:40.308 --> 00:58:42.143
[Students] Hello!

1126
00:58:51.069 --> 00:58:53.696
[cell phone vibrating sound]

1127
00:58:56.491 --> 00:58:59.619
[Rumbling sound]

1128
00:59:01.371 --> 00:59:03.706
- [It becomes quiet]
- [The vibration stops]

1129
00:59:05.833 --> 00:59:09.754
[Rumbling sound]

1130
00:59:11.047 --> 00:59:14.342
- [Roaring sound]
- [People screaming]

1131
00:59:14.425 --> 00:59:16.844
[♪ dark music]

1132
00:59:17.470 --> 00:59:18.846
[Soryong’s surprised gasp]

1133
00:59:18.930 --> 00:59:21.683
[Long creaking sound]

1134
00:59:21.766 --> 00:59:23.851
[Roaring sound]

1135
00:59:26.354 --> 00:59:28.439
- [surprised gasp]
- [Tense sound effect]

1136
00:59:34.779 --> 00:59:38.283
[♪ Soft and rhythmic music
'Pacemaker']

1137
00:59:49.377 --> 00:59:52.088
- [Woman] Daughter! The food is ready
- [Sound of news streaming]

1138
00:59:52.171 --> 00:59:54.173
[Student] No, no, no.
I'm late, I have to go quickly

1139
00:59:54.257 --> 00:59:55.425
[Woman] Hey, hey

1140
00:59:55.508 --> 00:59:56.509
Take at least a spoonful and go

1141
00:59:56.593 --> 00:59:58.428
[Student] No
This is so delicious, I'm full now

1142
00:59:58.511 --> 01:00:02.307
If I eat breakfast in the morning, I feel bad
How many times do I tell my mom

1143
01:00:02.390 --> 01:00:06.436
And I had a morning like I never did before.
Why did you suddenly do this?

1144
01:00:06.519 --> 01:00:09.814
[Woman] No
I just opened my eyes this morning

1145
01:00:09.897 --> 01:00:10.773
[Student] It appeared?

1146
01:00:10.857 --> 01:00:12.775
To my daughter
I want to cook you a meal

1147
01:00:12.859 --> 01:00:14.527
[Student] Oh, did you say that?

1148
01:00:14.611 --> 01:00:15.945
- [Woman’s laughter]
- But mom

1149
01:00:16.029 --> 01:00:17.488
They say that if people do something they don't do, they die.

1150
01:00:17.572 --> 01:00:18.781
[Woman] Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey

1151
01:00:18.865 --> 01:00:19.991
[Both laugh]

1152
01:00:20.074 --> 01:00:21.909
[Student] Oh, right, and
Don't wear socks to my cat

1153
01:00:21.993 --> 01:00:24.370
That's mine, mom, ha, athlete's foot

1154
01:00:24.454 --> 01:00:26.289
Until I come home from school
Anyway, suck it up, here I go.

1155
01:00:26.372 --> 01:00:28.124
- [Woman] Daughter, be careful!
- [Sound of door closing]

1156
01:00:28.207 --> 01:00:30.168
Ugh, that bastard, Seung-jil is

1157
01:00:31.085 --> 01:00:32.337
It suits you well

1158
01:00:32.420 --> 01:00:33.630
Right?

1159
01:00:33.713 --> 01:00:35.256
Meow

1160
01:00:38.509 --> 01:00:41.346
[♪ ‘Pacemaker’ continues]

